* <SIGNATURE>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* | Static Public Method ZCL_IM_APREQUEST_UPDATE=>CHANGE_PARTNER
* +-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* | [<-->] XIHPA                          TYPE        TT_IHPAVB
* +--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</SIGNATURE>
  METHOD change_partner.
* This is method will be called from implicit enhancement
* This method is responsible to change YS partner id based on
* position id
* CRQ No: 28668
* Transport No 943978
    DATA: lv_fname TYPE string VALUE '(SAPLAIA1)RAIP1'.
    DATA: lv_tabix TYPE sy-tabix.
    DATA: lv_parnr TYPE i_parnr.
    DATA: lwa_xihpa LIKE LINE OF xihpa.
    DATA: lt_pos_partner  TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF zim_pos_partner,
          lwa_pos_partner TYPE zim_pos_partner.
    FIELD-SYMBOLS: <fs_raip1> TYPE raip1.
* Fetch Position id
    ASSIGN (lv_fname) TO <fs_raip1>.
    CHECK <fs_raip1> IS ASSIGNED.
* Fetch Parnter maintained in Position id
    SELECT * FROM zim_pos_partner
      INTO TABLE lt_pos_partner
     WHERE posid EQ <fs_raip1>-posid
       AND zim_rectype EQ 'D'.
* "Check whether any default partner maintained in DB table
    CHECK lt_pos_partner IS NOT INITIAL.
* " Change Partner if its not matched with default partner
    LOOP AT xihpa INTO lwa_xihpa.
      lv_tabix = sy-tabix.
      READ TABLE lt_pos_partner INTO lwa_pos_partner
                            WITH KEY patner = lwa_xihpa-parvw.
      CHECK sy-subrc EQ 0.
      CHECK lwa_xihpa-parnr NE lwa_pos_partner-parnr.
      lwa_xihpa-parnr = lwa_pos_partner-parnr.
      MODIFY xihpa FROM lwa_xihpa INDEX lv_tabix TRANSPORTING parnr.
    ENDLOOP.
  ENDMETHOD.


